<title>USA: St Joseph boosts number shrs to be offered in IPO.</title>
<headline>St Joseph boosts number shrs to be offered in IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>St Joseph Capital Corp has increased the number of shares to be offered in its proposed initial public offering to 1.1 million from its previous proposal of 1.0 million, according to Robert Baird &amp; Co on Friday.</p>
<p>St Joseph, expected to price at $10, is tentatively scheduled to price sometime next week.</p>
</text>
